#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:74
msgid ""
"An element is one piece of the information that identifies what changes. "
"This entry uses two kinds of elements:"
msgstr ""
"要素は, 何が変化したかを特定する情報の 1 つ 1 つです. この仕訳では 2 種類の要"
