msgid "Base and hat base: `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)`"
msgstr "基底と Hat 基底: `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:85
msgid ""
"A base is a tuple of elements. `(Cash, Yen)` is the base for cash in yen, "
"and `(Deposits, Yen)` is the base for savings deposits in yen. A hat base "
"pairs a base with a direction through `:<`."
msgstr ""
"基底は要素の組です. `(Cash, Yen)` は円建ての現金, `(Deposits, Yen)` は円建て"
"の普通預金の基底です. 基底に `:<` で方向を付けた組が Hat 基底です."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:87
msgid ""
"The direction `Not` represents an increase, and `Hat` represents a decrease. "
"For revenue and expenses, they represent recognition and reversal, "
"respectively. The amount is nonnegative in both directions. The direction "
"and the account's division together determine the debit or credit side, as "
"Table 2 shows."
msgstr ""
"方向 `Not` は増加を, `Hat` は減少を表します. 収益と費用では, それぞれ発生と消"
"滅に当たります. 金額はどちらの方向でも非負です. 借方と貸方は, 表 2 のとおり, "
"方向と勘定科目の区分の組で決まります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:89
msgid "`Not`"
msgstr "`Not`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:89 src/algebra/elements.md:168
msgid "`Hat`"
msgstr "`Hat`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:91 src/accounts/builtin.md:14
msgid "Assets"
msgstr "資産"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:91
msgid "Increase (debit)"
msgstr "増加 (借方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:91
msgid "Decrease (credit)"
msgstr "減少 (貸方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:92
msgid "Liabilities, equity"
msgstr "負債, 純資産"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:92
msgid "Increase (credit)"
msgstr "増加 (貸方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:92
msgid "Decrease (debit)"
msgstr "減少 (借方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:93 src/accounts/builtin.md:171
msgid "Revenue"
msgstr "収益"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:93
msgid "Recognition (credit)"
msgstr "発生 (貸方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:93
msgid "Reversal (debit)"
msgstr "消滅 (借方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:94 src/accounts/builtin.md:218
msgid "Expenses"
msgstr "費用"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:94
msgid "Recognition (debit)"
msgstr "発生 (借方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:94
msgid "Reversal (credit)"
msgstr "消滅 (貸方)"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:96
msgid ""
"_Table 2. The meaning of `Not` and `Hat` and the resulting side, by account "
"division._"
msgstr "_表 2. 勘定科目の区分ごとに見た `Not` と `Hat` の意味と貸借._"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:98
msgid ""
"Cash and deposits are assets. Thus `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` is an increase in "
"cash on the debit side, and `Hat :< (Deposits, Yen)` is a decrease in "
"deposits on the credit side."
msgstr ""
"現金と普通預金は資産です. したがって, `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` は現金の増加で借"
"方, `Hat :< (Deposits, Yen)` は普通預金の減少で貸方になります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:100
msgid ""
"For a contra account, read the direction as a change in that account itself. "
"`Not` on `AccumulatedDepreciation` is an increase in accumulated "
"depreciation and falls on the credit side."
msgstr ""
"評価勘定では, 方向をその科目自身の増減として読みます. "
"`AccumulatedDepreciation` の `Not` は減価償却累計額の増加で, 貸方になります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:102
msgid ""
"**Note:** The side that increases `CashOverShort`, `IncomeSummary`, or "
"`SuspenseAccount` depends on the context. The library gives them the same "
"sides as assets: `Not` is a debit and `Hat` is a credit."
msgstr ""
"**補足:** `CashOverShort`, `IncomeSummary`, `SuspenseAccount` では, 増加が借"
"方と貸方のどちらに当たるかが文脈で決まります. ライブラリはこの 3 科目に資産と"
"同じ貸借を割り当て, `Not` を借方, `Hat` を貸方とします."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:104
msgid "Redundant algebra: `Alg`"
msgstr "冗長代数: `Alg`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:106
msgid ""
"`Alg MoneyDecimal (HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit))` is the type of a "
"redundant algebra. Its first argument is the amount type, and its second is "
"the hat base type. `MoneyDecimal` stores decimal amounts without binary "
"rounding."
msgstr ""
"`Alg MoneyDecimal (HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit))` は冗長代数の型です. 第 1 "
"引数が金額の型, 第 2 引数が Hat 基底の型です. `MoneyDecimal` は金額を 10 進数"
"のまま保持するので, 2 進数への変換による丸め誤差が生じません."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:108
msgid ""
"`.@` attaches an amount to a hat base to make a term, and `.+` adds terms. "
"The first line of the output is the sum of the two terms. Addition keeps "
"every term, even on the same base. To net the terms on each base, apply "
"`bar` explicitly."
msgstr ""
"`.@` は金額を Hat 基底に付けて項を作り, `.+` は項を加えます. 出力の 1 行目は "
"2 つの項の和です. 加えた項は, 基底が同じでもすべて残ります. 基底ごとに相殺し"
"て集約するには, `bar` を明示的に適用してください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:110
msgid "Exchange algebra: `ExBaseClass`"
msgstr "交換代数: `ExBaseClass`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:112
msgid ""
"The instance of `ExBaseClass` defines where the account title is in the "
"base. `getAccountTitle` reads the title, and `setAccountTitle` replaces it "
"while keeping the direction and the unit. `FlexibleInstances` permits this "
"instance declaration."
msgstr ""
"`ExBaseClass` の instance には, 基底のどこに勘定科目があるかを書きます. "
"`getAccountTitle` は勘定科目を読み出し, `setAccountTitle` は方向と単位を保っ"
"たまま勘定科目を置き換えます. この instance の宣言には `FlexibleInstances` が"
"必要です."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:114
msgid ""
"With this instance, the redundant algebra is an exchange algebra, and three "
"more functions are available:"
msgstr ""
"この instance があると冗長代数は交換代数になり, 次の 3 つの関数を使えます."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:116
msgid ""
"`decL` selects the debit (left) terms, which form the second line of the "
"output."
msgstr "`decL` は借方 (左) の項を選びます. 出力の 2 行目に当たります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:117
msgid "`decR` selects the credit (right) terms, which form the third line."
msgstr "`decR` は貸方 (右) の項を選びます. 出力の 3 行目に当たります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:118
msgid ""
"`balance` compares the debit and credit totals. The last line, `True`, means "
"that they agree."
msgstr ""
"`balance` は借方と貸方の合計を比べます. 最終行の `True` は, 両者の一致を表し"
"ます."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:120
msgid ""
"`balance` compares amounts only. It does not detect a wrong account title or "
"convert between units, so apply it to terms in a single unit."
msgstr ""
"`balance` は金額だけを比べます. 勘定科目の誤りの検出や単位の換算はしないの"
"で, 単位が 1 種類の項に適用してください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:122
msgid "Use the program for your entry"
msgstr "手元の仕訳に使う"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:124
msgid ""
"To record another entry in yen, change three parts of each term in "
"`withdrawal`:"
msgstr ""
"円建ての別の仕訳を記録するには, `withdrawal` の各項で次の 3 か所を書き換えて"
"ください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:126
msgid ""
"Replace the account title with one from [Built-in account titles](../"
"accounts/builtin.md)."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目を[組み込みの勘定科目](../accounts/builtin.md)から選んだ科目に置き換"
"えてください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:127
msgid "Select `Not` or `Hat` from Table 2."
msgstr "表 2 から `Not` か `Hat` を選んでください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:128
msgid ""
"Replace `3000` with a nonnegative amount. `.@` stops with an error for a "
"negative amount."
msgstr ""
"`3000` を非負の金額に置き換えてください. 負の金額を渡すと, `.@` はエラーで停"
"止します."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:130
msgid ""
"If the entry has more than two terms, join the additional terms with `.+`. "
"Run the program again, and check that the last line is `True`."
msgstr ""
"項が 3 つ以上あるときは, 追加する項を `.+` でつないでください. プログラムを再"
"実行し, 最終行が `True` であることを確かめてください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:132
msgid ""
"If this form is sufficient, continue with [Transfers](../exchange/"
"transfer.md). To customize it, read the chapter for the component that you "
"want to change:"
msgstr ""
"この形で足りる場合は, [振替](../exchange/transfer.md)の章へ進んでください. カ"
"スタマイズする場合は, 変更する構成要素に応じて次の章を読んでください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:134
msgid "To declare or add an element, read [Elements](../algebra/elements.md)."
msgstr ""
"要素を宣言または追加する場合は, [要素](../algebra/elements.md)の章を読んでく"
"ださい."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:135
msgid ""
"To change the combination of elements, read [Bases](../algebra/bases.md)."
msgstr ""
"要素の組み合わせを変える場合は, [基底](../algebra/bases.md)の章を読んでくださ"
"い."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:136
msgid ""
"To change the amount type or use other operations, read [Values](../algebra/"
"values.md) and [The redundant algebra](../algebra/redundant.md)."
msgstr ""
"金額の型を変える場合や他の演算を使う場合は, [値](../algebra/values.md)と[冗長"
"代数](../algebra/redundant.md)の章を読んでください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:138
msgid "Tested with exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1 on 2026-11-22."
msgstr "2026-11-22 に exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1 で検証しました."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:3
msgid ""
"On January 10, a business withdraws 3,000 yen from its savings account at "
"Bank A and receives the same amount in cash. The journal entry is a debit to "
"Cash for 3,000 yen and a credit to Deposits for 3,000 yen. To represent the "
"entry in exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1, separate the information that identifies "
"an amount from the amount itself."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日に, 事業者が A 銀行の普通預金口座から 3,000 円を引き出し, 同額の現"
"金を受け取ります. 仕訳は, 借方が現金 3,000 円, 貸方が預金 3,000 円です. この"
"仕訳を exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1 で表すために, 金額を識別する情報と金額そのもの"
"を分けます."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:5
msgid ""
"An element is a member of an element set. The account title and currency "
"unit are elements of the bases in the withdrawal. This is the [Element "
"structure of Definition 1](definitions.md#element-structure). The examples "
"assume a project prepared with [Installation and modules](../usage/"
"installation.md)."
msgstr ""
"要素は要素集合の元です. 勘定科目と通貨単位は, 引き出しの項 の基底を構成する要"
"素です. これが[定義 1 の要素構造](definitions.md#element-structure)です. 例"
"は, [導入とモジュール](../usage/installation.md)に従ってプロジェクトを準備し"
"てあることを前提とします."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:7
msgid "Choose elements for the withdrawal"
msgstr "引き出しの要素を選ぶ"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:9
msgid ""
"The withdrawal contains a date, a bank account, two account titles, a "
"currency unit, and an amount. Their roles depend on what must be "
"distinguished in the resulting balances:"
msgstr ""
"引き出しには, 日付, 銀行口座, 2 つの勘定科目, 通貨単位, 金額が含まれます. そ"
"れぞれの役割は, 求める残高で何を区別する必要があるかによって決まります:"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:11
msgid ""
"**Account titles:** Cash and Deposits identify the holdings that change. The "
"account title is an element of each term's base."
msgstr ""
"**勘定科目:** 現金と預金は, 変化する保有物を識別します. 勘定科目は各項の基底"
"を構成する要素です."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:12
msgid ""
"**Unit:** Yen identifies the unit of the amount. Keeping it as an element "
"prevents yen and dollar amounts from canceling against each other."
msgstr ""
"**単位:** 円は金額の単位を識別します. 単位を要素として保持すると, 円とドルの"
"金額が互いに相殺されるのを防げます."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:13
msgid ""
"**Amount:** 3,000 is the value attached to each term separately from the "
"base."
msgstr "**金額:** 3,000 は, 基底とは別に各項に付ける値です."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:14
msgid ""
"**Date and bank account:** January 10 and Bank A's savings account identify "
"the transaction and its source. In this example, the date and account "
"description are journal metadata because the desired balances combine dates "
"and do not distinguish bank accounts."
msgstr ""
"**日付と銀行口座:** 1 月 10 日と A 銀行の普通預金口座は, 取引とその資金の出所"
"を識別します. この例では, 求める残高は日付をまとめ, 銀行口座を区別しないた"
"め, 日付と口座の記述を仕訳帳のメタデータにします."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:16
msgid ""
"If separate balances by date or bank account are required, include date or "
"bank account elements in the base. Here the base needs only an account title "
"and a currency unit. The built-in `AccountTitles` type already has an "
"`Element` instance. Its constructors `Cash` and `Deposits` name the two "
"accounts; `Deposits` denotes savings deposits, rather than current deposits "
"or deposits received as a liability."
msgstr ""
"日付別や銀行口座別の残高が必要なら, 日付や銀行口座の要素を基底に含めてくださ"
"い. ここでは, 基底に必要なのは勘定科目と通貨単位だけです. 組み込みの "
"`AccountTitles` 型には既に `Element` instance があります. そのコンストラク"
"ター `Cash` と `Deposits` が 2 つの勘定を表します. `Deposits` は普通預金を意"
"味し, 当座預金や負債としての預り金ではありません."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:18
msgid "Declare a unit element type"
msgstr "単位の要素の型を宣言する"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:20
msgid ""
"Define a currency type with `Yen`, `Dollar`, and a distinguished wildcard "
"`Unit`. The declaration supplies `Eq`, `Ord`, `Show`, and `Hashable`, which "
"are superclasses of `Element`; GHC supplies `Typeable` automatically. "
"`DeriveGeneric` and `DeriveAnyClass` provide the generic `Hashable` "
"instance. The only class method needed for this simple element type is "
"`wildcard`."
msgstr ""
"`Yen`, `Dollar`, 特別なワイルドカード `Unit` を持つ通貨の型を定義してくださ"
"い. この宣言は, `Element` のスーパークラスである `Eq`, `Ord`, `Show`, "
"`Hashable` を備えます. GHC は `Typeable` を自動的に備えます. `DeriveGeneric` "
"と `DeriveAnyClass` は汎用的な `Hashable` instance を生成します. この単純な要"
"素の型に必要なクラスメソッドは `wildcard` だけです."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:22
msgid "Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`:"
msgstr "コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください:"

