#: src/algebra/elements.md:172
msgid ""
"`Int`, `Integer`, `Double`, and `String` require a wrapper to serve as "
"element types in 0.6.1.1. Use `Wild` to give each type a wildcard."
msgstr ""
"0.6.1.1 で `Int`, `Integer`, `Double`, `String` を要素の型として使うには, こ"
"れらの型を包む型が必要です. `Wild` で包むと, ワイルドカードを加えられます."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:174
msgid ""
"`Wild a` has `Element` and `BaseClass` instances when `a` has `Ord`, `Show`, "
"`Hashable`, and `Typeable` instances. It derives `Eq`, `Ord`, `Show`, and "
"`Generic`, and has `NFData`, `Hashable`, and `Binary` instances when `a` has "
"the corresponding instance."
msgstr ""
"`a` が `Ord`, `Show`, `Hashable`, `Typeable` の instance を持つとき, `Wild "
"a` は `Element` と `BaseClass` の instance を持ちます. `Eq`, `Ord`, `Show`, "
"`Generic` は導出され, `NFData`, `Hashable`, `Binary` は `a` が対応する "
"instance を持つときに使えます."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:176
msgid ""
"The `Element` instances for `Day` and `TimeOfDay` use 1858-11-17 and 00:00 "
"as wildcards, respectively. To record and query those values as ordinary "
"elements, use `Wild Day` or `Wild TimeOfDay` with `Exactly`."
msgstr ""
"`Day` と `TimeOfDay` の `Element` instance は, それぞれ 1858-11-17 と 00:00 "
"をワイルドカードとして使います. これらの値を通常の要素として記録し, 問い合わ"
"せるには, `Wild Day` または `Wild TimeOfDay` で `Exactly` を使ってください."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:3
msgid ""
"The January 10 withdrawal increases cash and decreases the savings deposit "
"by 3,000 yen. The base of each term contains an account element and a "
"currency element. Their directions differ: the cash term has `Not`, and the "
"deposit term has `Hat`."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日の引き出しでは, 現金が 3,000 円増加し, 普通預金が 3,000 円減少しま"
"す. 各項の基底には勘定科目の要素と通貨の要素が入ります. 方向は異なり, 現金の"
"項 は `Not`, 預金の項は `Hat` を持ちます."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:5
msgid ""
"These bases implement [Definition 2](definitions.md#bases) and [Definition 3]"
"(definitions.md#hat-bases-and-postings). The example uses "
"exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1 and the custom currency element type from [Declare a "
"unit element type](elements.md#declare-a-unit-element-type)."
msgstr ""
"これらの基底は[定義 2](definitions.md#bases) と[定義 3](definitions.md#hat-"
"bases-and-postings) を実装します. この例では exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1 と, [単"
"位の要素の型を宣言する](elements.md#declare-a-unit-element-type)で定義した通"
"貨の要素の型を使います."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:7
msgid "Describe the two changes"
msgstr "2 つの変化を記述する"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:9
msgid ""
"The base `(Cash, Yen)` identifies cash measured in yen; `(Deposits, Yen)` "
"identifies savings deposits measured in yen. A `HatBase` pairs each base "
"with its direction through the constructor `(:<)`. `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` "
"records the direction of the cash increase, and `Hat :< (Deposits, Yen)` "
"records the direction of the deposit decrease. Neither expression contains "
"the amount yet."
msgstr ""
"基底 `(Cash, Yen)` は円で測る現金を表し, `(Deposits, Yen)` は円で測る普通預金"
"を表します. `HatBase` はコンストラクター `(:<)` を通じて各基底とその方向を組"
"にします. `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` は現金増加の方向を記録し, `Hat :< (Deposits, "
"Yen)` は預金減少の方向を記録します. どちらの式にもまだ金額は含まれていません."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:11
msgid "Keep the same custom `Unit` declaration in the standalone program:"
msgstr "単独で実行するプログラムにも, 同じ独自の `Unit` 宣言を残してください:"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:32
msgid "Define the account-and-unit bases"
msgstr "勘定科目と単位の基底を定義する"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:34
msgid "Construct both sides of the withdrawal with the account and unit pairs:"
msgstr "勘定科目と単位の組で, 引き出しの両側を構築してください:"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:37
msgid "-- | Cash increases in the withdrawal.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出しで現金が増加します.\n"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:40
msgid "-- | The savings deposit decreases in the withdrawal.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出しで普通預金が減少します.\n"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:46
msgid ""
"`BaseClass` describes the underlying base space. The library already has "
"`BaseClass` instances for tuples of 2 through 7 `Element` types, so "
"`(AccountTitles, Unit)` needs no new `BaseClass` declaration. The "
"`HatBaseClass` instance for `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` also exists once "
"the requirements on the element types are met. No user-defined "
"implementation of the direction methods is needed for these bases."
msgstr ""
"`BaseClass` は方向を付ける前の基底空間を記述します. ライブラリは, 2 個から 7 "
"個の `Element` 型を組にしたタプルに `BaseClass` の instance をすでに提供して"
"いるので, `(AccountTitles, Unit)` に新たな `BaseClass` 宣言は不要です. 要素の"
"型の要件を満たせば, `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` の `HatBaseClass` の "
"instance も存在します. これらの基底について, 利用者が方向のメソッドを実装する"
"必要はありません."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:48
msgid "Use a single unit as a base"
msgstr "単一の単位を基底として使う"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:50
msgid ""
"If the underlying base is just `Unit`, rather than an account-and-unit pair, "
"declare `BaseClass Unit`. This separate declaration is needed for `HatBase "
"Unit`, as in this example with one element:"
msgstr ""
"方向を付ける前の基底が勘定科目と単位の組ではなく `Unit` だけの場合は, "
"`BaseClass Unit` を宣言してください. この個別の宣言は, 要素が 1 つの次の例の"
"ように `HatBase Unit` を使う場合に必要です:"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:53
msgid ""
"-- | Permit Unit itself, as well as tuples containing it, to be a base.\n"
msgstr "-- | Unit を含むタプルに加え, Unit 自体も基底にできるようにします.\n"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:55
msgid ""
"-- | A base with one element, used to compare the instance requirements.\n"
msgstr "-- | instance の要件を比較するために使う, 要素が 1 つの基底です.\n"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:61
msgid ""
"`yenOnly` identifies a unit without an account. The withdrawal uses "
"`cashIncrease` and `depositDecrease` instead, so its changes remain "
"distinguishable by account. The empty instance uses the default "
"`compareBase` implementation."
msgstr ""
"`yenOnly` は勘定科目を持たず, 単位を表します. 引き出しでは代わりに "
"`cashIncrease` と `depositDecrease` を使うので, 変化を勘定科目で区別できま"
"す. 空の instance は既定の `compareBase` 実装を使います."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:63
msgid "Inspect the withdrawal bases"
msgstr "引き出しの基底を調べる"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:65
msgid ""
"Extract the underlying base with `base` and the direction with `hat`. "
"`revHat cashIncrease` changes the direction to a cash decrease without "
"changing `(Cash, Yen)`. `merge` reconstructs the deposit base from its "
"direction and underlying base."
msgstr ""
"`base` で方向を付ける前の基底を, `hat` で方向を取り出してください. `revHat "
"cashIncrease` は `(Cash, Yen)` を変えずに, 方向を現金の減少に変えます. "
"`merge` は方向と方向を付ける前の基底から預金の基底を再構築します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:71
msgid "-- | Print the withdrawal's bases and inspect their directions.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出しの基底を表示し, その方向を調べます.\n"

