"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`. Declare how to "
"read and replace the account title in the custom base:"
msgstr ""
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください. 自作の基底から勘定"
"科目を読み出し, 置き換える方法を宣言してください:"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:29 src/exchange/transfer.md:29
#: src/journal/journal.md:31
msgid "-- | Account access for the custom account-and-currency base.\n"
msgstr "-- | 自作の勘定科目と通貨の基底で勘定科目へアクセスします.\n"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:36
msgid ""
"`FlexibleInstances` is needed for the instance head `HatBase (AccountTitles, "
"Unit)`. `DeriveGeneric` and `DeriveAnyClass` supply the `Hashable` instance "
"for `Unit`. `ExchangeAlgebra` re-exports the types and classes used by these "
"declarations; the accounting classes are also available from "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange`."
msgstr ""
"`FlexibleInstances` は instance の頭部 `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` に必要"
"です. `DeriveGeneric` と `DeriveAnyClass` は `Unit` に `Hashable` instance を"
"備えます. `ExchangeAlgebra` はこれらの宣言に使う型とクラスを再公開します. 会"
"計のクラスは `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange` からも利用できます."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:38
msgid ""
"The built-in `ExBaseClass` instances cover several specific base shapes, but "
"do not cover this custom account-and-unit base. Define `getAccountTitle` and "
"`setAccountTitle`. The setter retains direction and currency. The remaining "
"methods have defaults derived from the account title and direction, so no "
"new `Exchange` instance is needed for `Alg`."
msgstr ""
"組み込みの `ExBaseClass` instance は複数の具体的な基底の形に対応しますが, こ"
"の自作の勘定科目と単位の基底には対応しません. `getAccountTitle` と "
"`setAccountTitle` を定義してください. setter は方向と通貨を保持します. 残りの"
"メソッドには勘定科目と方向から導く既定の実装があるので, `Alg` に新たな "
"`Exchange` instance は不要です."

