#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:3
msgid ""
"Start from the checked January journal in [Checking a journal]"
"(admission.md#admit-the-january-journal). A trial balance collects each "
"account’s debit and credit totals and its remaining debit or credit balance. "
"Equal totals are necessary for double-entry bookkeeping, but an omitted "
"balanced entry can leave them equal."
msgstr ""
"[仕訳帳の検査](admission.md#admit-the-january-journal)で検査を通った 1 月の仕"
"訳帳から始めます. 試算表には勘定ごとの借方合計, 貸方合計, 借方残高または貸方"
"残高をまとめます. 複式簿記では貸借の合計が一致する必要がありますが, 貸借が一"
"致する仕訳を丸ごと除いても合計は一致します."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:7
msgid "Recover the checked records"
msgstr "検査を通った記録の取り出し"

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:9
msgid ""
"The program begins with the records, currency conversion, journal checking, "
"and display helpers from [Checking a journal](admission.md#prepare-the-"
"january-records)."
msgstr ""
"プログラムは, [仕訳帳の検査](admission.md#prepare-the-january-records)で説明"
"した記録, 通貨の換算, 仕訳帳の検査, 表示用の補助関数から始まります."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:124
msgid ""
"The opening contribution, the two withdrawals, the purchase, the cash sale, "
"and the rent payment are unchanged. Dollar cash has already been expressed "
"in yen. Recover the record with `Admission.admittedJournal`, then remove "
"note keys with `Journal.toAlg` when calculating balances across the month. "
"Neither operation nets terms."
msgstr ""
"期首の払込, 2 件の引き出し, 仕入, 現金売上, 家賃の支払をそのまま使います. ド"
"ル現金は円に換算済みです. `Admission.admittedJournal` で記録を取り出し, 月全"
"体の残高を計算するときに `Journal.toAlg` で摘要のキーを外してください. いずれ"
"の操作も項を相殺しません."

