#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:230
msgid ""
"With the opening contribution, Deposits has a debit balance of 5,000 yen and "
"the balance columns each total 12,000 yen. Cash has a debit balance of 5,300 "
"yen, including the yen equivalent of the 10 dollars. Its debit total is "
"8,500 yen and its credit total is 3,200 yen."
msgstr ""
"期首の払込を含めると, Deposits は借方残高 5,000 円となり, 残高欄の合計は貸借"
"ともに 12,000 円です. Cash は, 10 ドルを円換算した額を含めて借方残高 5,300 円"
"です. Cash の借方合計と貸方合計は, それぞれ 8,500 円と 3,200 円です."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:232
msgid ""
"Remove the opening contribution as a whole and the journal still passes the "
"check: the terms under each remaining note balance. Deposits then has a "
"credit balance of 5,000 yen. `UnexplainedAbnormalBalance Deposits Debit "
"(CreditBalance 5000)` reports that Deposits normally has a debit balance. "
"Findings neither reject nor repair the journal. For these records, restore "
"the independently confirmed opening contribution; do not invent a balancing "
"entry merely to remove the finding."
msgstr ""
"期首の払込を丸ごと除いても, 残る各摘要の項の貸借は一致するため, 仕訳帳は検査"
"を通ります. その場合, Deposits は貸方残高 5,000 円になります. "
"`UnexplainedAbnormalBalance Deposits Debit (CreditBalance 5000)` は, "
"Deposits の本来の残高が借方であることを示す指摘事項です. 指摘事項によって仕訳"
"帳が拒否されたり訂正されたりすることはありません. この記録では, 別の証拠で確"
"かめた期首の払込を戻してください. 指摘事項を消すためだけに貸借を合わせる仕訳"
"を作らないでください."

