msgstr "\"Ending inventory\""

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:203
msgid ""
"Use `Entries.cogsAdjustmentEntries` with a `MkBase` that fills in `Yen`, "
"because the entry builder accepts the existing account-and-currency base "
"while retaining all its elements. Its arguments are the beginning and ending "
"inventory amounts, not the purchases total. A zero beginning inventory "
"produces no zero-valued terms. The builder returns only additional terms, "
"without implicit `bar` or `compress`; attach a note and add them to the "
"journal with `.+`."
msgstr ""
"`Entries.cogsAdjustmentEntries` に, 単位を `Yen` とする `MkBase` を渡してくだ"
"さい. この関数は, 勘定科目と通貨を持つ既存の基底をそのまま受け取るため, 基底"
"の要素をすべて保って決算整理仕訳を生成できます. 引数は期首商品棚卸高と期末商"
"品棚卸高であり, 仕入高ではありません. 期首商品棚卸高が 0 の場合, 値が 0 の項"
"は生成しません. 関数が返すのは追加する項だけです. 暗黙に `bar` や `compress` "
"は適用しません. 摘要を付け, `.+` で仕訳帳に加えてください."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:205
