#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:241
msgid ""
"The rent and inventory adjustments remain separately selectable under their "
"January 31 notes. Checking the journal again checks their debit-credit "
"equality along with the original entries. The adjusted trial balance has "
"PrepaidExpenses of 600 yen, MerchandiseInventory of 200 yen, Purchases of "
"300 yen, and RentExpense of 600 yen. Balance totals remain 12,000 yen on "
"each side; gross term totals increase to 21,000 yen because the added "
"entries remain in the record."
msgstr ""
"家賃と商品の決算整理仕訳は, それぞれの 1 月 31 日の摘要で個別に選べます. 再検"
"査では, 元の仕訳とともに, 追加した仕訳の貸借の一致を検査します. 決算整理後の"
"試算表には, PrepaidExpenses が 600 円, MerchandiseInventory が 200 円, "
"Purchases が 300 円, RentExpense が 600 円残ります. 残高の合計は貸借ともに "
"12,000 円のままです. 追加した仕訳が記録に残るため, 借方合計と貸方合計はそれぞ"
"れ 21,000 円に増えます."

