#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:3
msgid ""
"Prepare January’s closing entries after the rent and inventory adjustments "
"in [Adjusting entries](adjustment.md#admit-and-inspect-the-adjusted-"
"journal). Sales of 2,000 yen less cost of goods sold of 300 yen and rent "
"expense of 600 yen give a profit of 1,100 yen. Transfer the revenue and "
"expense balances to retained earnings, the equity account that accumulates "
"undistributed profits."
msgstr ""
"[決算整理仕訳](adjustment.md#admit-and-inspect-the-adjusted-journal)で家賃と"
"商品を整理してから, 1 月の決算振替仕訳を作ります. 売上 2,000 円から売上原価 "
"300 円と家賃 600 円を差し引くと, 当期利益は 1,100 円です. 収益と費用の残高"
"を, 未処分の利益を蓄積する純資産の勘定である繰越利益剰余金へ振り替えます."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:7
msgid "Recover the adjusted journal"
msgstr "決算整理後の仕訳帳の取り出し"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:9
msgid ""
"The program begins with the code from [Adjusting entries]"
"(adjustment.md#defer-rent-and-count-inventory) and the chapters before it."
msgstr ""
"プログラムは, [決算整理仕訳](adjustment.md#defer-rent-and-count-inventory)と"
"それまでの章で説明したコードから始まります."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:198
msgid "Generate closing entries"
msgstr "決算振替仕訳の生成"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:200
msgid ""
"`Closing.closingEntries` reads the ledger through the closing date and "
"returns only additional entries. For each eligible account-and-currency "
"base, it computes the exact net, reverses that balance, and adds a term with "
"the matching amount to `RetainedEarnings`. Other elements of the base are "
"preserved. It sums source balances internally, without calling `bar`; "
"separate contributions from different expense and revenue accounts remain "
"separate terms."
msgstr ""
"`Closing.closingEntries` は決算振替日までの記録を読み, 追加する仕訳だけを返し"
"ます. 決算振替の対象となる勘定科目と通貨の基底ごとに, 厳密な残高を求め, その"
"残高を取り消す項と, 対応する金額を `RetainedEarnings` に振り替える項を生成し"
"ます. 基底の他の要素は保ちます. 内部で元の残高を集計しますが, `bar` は呼びま"
"せん. 費用と収益の各勘定から生じた振替先の項は, 別々のまま残ります."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:202
msgid ""
"See [Account titles and their attributes](../accounts/attributes.md) for the "
"closing rule and division used to select accounts for transfer to "
"`RetainedEarnings`."
msgstr ""
"`RetainedEarnings` への振替の対象を選ぶ締めの規則と区分は[勘定科目と属性](../"
"accounts/attributes.md)を参照してください."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:205 src/bookkeeping/statements.md:165
#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:168 src/io/output.md:169
msgid ""
"-- | Generate additional closing entries from the adjusted ledger, then "
"check the resulting journal.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 決算整理後の記録から決算振替仕訳を生成し, 追加後の仕訳帳を検査します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:210 src/bookkeeping/statements.md:170
#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:173 src/io/output.md:174
msgid "\"Close January\""
msgstr "\"Close January\""

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:215
msgid ""
"For Sales, debit 2,000 yen by reversing its `Not` balance with `Hat`, and "
"credit RetainedEarnings. For Purchases and RentExpense, credit 300 and 600 "
"yen to cancel their debit balances, and debit RetainedEarnings for the same "
"amounts. RetainedEarnings therefore has credits of 2,000 yen and debits of "
"900 yen, leaving a credit balance of 1,100 yen. Japanese bookkeeping "
"textbooks collect revenue and expenses in an income summary account before "
"transferring the result to retained earnings, whereas "
"exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1’s `closingEntries` transfers those balances directly "
"to RetainedEarnings, producing the same final balances."
msgstr ""
"Sales は `Not` の残高を `Hat` で取り消して 2,000 円を借方に記録し, "
"RetainedEarnings を貸方に記録します. Purchases と RentExpense はそれぞれ 300 "
"円と 600 円を貸方に記録して借方残高を取り消し, 同額を RetainedEarnings の借方"
"に記録します. RetainedEarnings は貸方 2,000 円と借方 900 円となり, 貸方残高 "
"1,100 円が残ります. 日本の簿記の教科書では収益と費用をいったん損益勘定に集め"
"てから繰越利益剰余金へ振り替えますが, exchangealgebra-0.6.1.1 の "
"`closingEntries` は直接 RetainedEarnings へ振り替え, 最終的な残高は同じになり"
"ます."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:217
msgid "Inspect the post-closing trial balance"
msgstr "繰越試算表を点検する"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:230
msgid "\"Closing entries\""
msgstr "\"Closing entries\""

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:233
